{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "741e38d0-b794-8802-8b83-c4b42ea64297",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:27:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Tony. This is Linda Burdick. I got my water and sewer bill and there's a late FEE on it. A late fee! And I mailed that CHECK on time, weeks ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Let me pull up your account. Do you remember about when you mailed it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The first week of the month. I put it in the MAILBOX myself, with the flag up. I've done it that way for years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'm seeing the payment posted a few days after the due date, so the late charge went on automatically. The system goes by the date we receive it, not the postmark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's not my FAULT. The mail is slow. [pause] Hold on, I'm wiping my glasses, I can't read this print. There. Now, the bill is also very HIGH. Higher than usual."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see that too. Your usage jumped last month. Any idea why? Sometimes it's a leak."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the TOILET was running constantly last month. All day and night. My nephew's not here to fix it, so I jiggled the handle until it stopped, and then I had a man fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a running toilet can add up quick. That would explain the extra usage. It's a good thing it's fixed now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is fixed. But I'm not paying a late fee on a check I mailed ON TIME. I want a SUPERVISOR to review that charge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, that's fair. I can't remove it myself, but I'll send a note to my supervisor with your account and what you told me, and someone will call you back. Is 401-555-0151 the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. The landline. I'm home most days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll flag it today. Hang on to your bill in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T10:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Tony. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
